WEBVTT

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:10.010
<i>While engaging 
the Takeda in battle,</i>

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:16.360
<i>Julius Caesar, a Regalia user from 
the West, suddenly appeared.</i>

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:19.450
<i>His attack cost the Oda clan 
their clan lord, Nobuhide.</i>

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.920
<i>To outsiders, his death grants the 
perfect opportunity to attack the clan.</i>

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.800
<i>Within the clan, it is the spark 
that will ignite the feud</i>

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.780
<i>between Nobunaga and Nobukatsu's men.</i>

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.680
<i>With Nobuhide's death,</i>

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.100
<i>the Oda clan is now beset with troubles 
both from within and without,</i>

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.110
<i>and faced with unprecedented calamity.</i>

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:43.920
Let's stay here and keep watch for a while.

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:46.460
Once the castle faces certain doom,

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.000
you can use The Fool 
to save the day,

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.870
right in front of the advisors' very eyes.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:58.130
Hideyoshi...

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:58.990
Hey.

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:08.220
Nobuhide-sama,

00:03:09.030 --> 00:03:11.490
this is the best I can do right now,

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:15.610
but I'll continue to help 
Nobu-sama as much as I can.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.480
Turn that frown upside-down!

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.000
It's not your fault.

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:27.170
That Western Regalia user 
attacked us out of nowhere.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:35.290
Mitsu, the three of us are 
gonna change the world, right?

00:03:48.650 --> 00:03:51.770
Father wanted Brother to have this?

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:56.040
The inheritance...

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.730
Nobunaga-sama is nowhere to be found?

00:04:08.730 --> 00:04:11.410
Who will make arrangements 
for Nobuhide-sama's funeral?

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:12.910
Good grief!

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:15.480
Still playing the fool, 
even during this crisis!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:24.530
Mitsuhide,

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:25.880
do you know where Nobunaga is?

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:27.400
Who knows?

00:04:28.960 --> 00:04:30.460
He's not even in the workshop?

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:32.600
You don't need to look for him.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.400
What?

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.870
The castle folk may be raising a fuss,

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:37.020
but pay them no mind.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:37.930
But...

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.230
Nobu will come.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:42.910
He just needs a little time.

00:04:44.900 --> 00:04:45.870
Ranmaru.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.640
You, above all others,

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:51.420
I ask to stay calm and wait for him.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.380
Mitsuhide...

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:01.600
All right. See you later.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:14.490
What is Nobunaga-sama thinking?

00:05:14.490 --> 00:05:18.950
Indeed. It is his own father's funeral.

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.100
Nobukatsu-sama.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:38.870
I beg of you, please preside over the funeral

00:05:38.870 --> 00:05:40.260
and begin the rites.

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:42.570
But we should wait for Nobunaga.

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.660
We have waited for him long enough.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:47.860
If the first son is not present,

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:51.880
it is the second son's 
duty to fulfill his role.

00:05:52.270 --> 00:05:55.540
We cannot delay the rites any further.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:56.590
Please.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:58.140
Hayashi-dono.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:02.060
Is it in our best interest to conduct 
the rites without the heir present?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:06.750
Is it in our best interest 
for the heir to be absent?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:07.860
But...

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.370
Mitsuhide, enough.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:13.390
It pains me to see our 
lack of unity on display

00:06:13.390 --> 00:06:17.280
in an argument before 
Nobuhide-sama himself.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.110
Come, Nobukatsu-sama.

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.310
It was also Nobuhide-sama's wish

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.480
to have you protect the clan, 
Nobukatsu-sama.

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:28.770
Nobukatsu-sama!

00:06:30.810 --> 00:06:34.390
You must make your 
own decision, Nobukatsu.

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:40.760
Then I will, but strictly 
as my brother's proxy.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.030
If that is everyone's wish...

00:06:53.460 --> 00:06:57.570
Now, let us now begin the funeral rites 
for Oda's clan lord, Oda Nobuhide—

00:06:57.570 --> 00:06:58.780
Nobunaga-sama!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:01.780
P-Please wait!

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:10.490
Wh...

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:15.210
What unconscionable attire!

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:45.090
Nobu!

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:13.590
Halt!

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.910
You may be the heir,

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:20.430
but such wanton, 
disruptive behavior at this solemn funeral

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.010
will not be tolerated!

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:26.520
You... fool!

00:08:45.020 --> 00:08:45.830
Hm...

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:06.970
Hey!

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.210
What's your problem?!

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:12.840
You...

00:09:12.840 --> 00:09:14.720
You enormous fool!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.830
This is an act of treason 
against the clan lord.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:25.360
Nobunaga is not worthy of becoming clan lord!

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.200
Seize him.

00:09:32.070 --> 00:09:33.570
Seize Hayashi-dono!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:39.310
Seize him.

00:09:40.170 --> 00:09:42.470
I can take myself to the dungeon.

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.320
Get it done.

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:04.210
Father...

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:10.430
Father, you often enjoyed 
tea under this cherry tree.

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:15.620
I remember well the tales 
you used to tell me

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:18.450
of far-off lands and my deceased mother...

00:10:19.030 --> 00:10:22.240
But I will never hear them again.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.200
For some reason, I cannot cry.

00:10:29.380 --> 00:10:31.660
It is easier to smile.

00:10:32.490 --> 00:10:33.800
Ichihime-sama.

00:10:34.790 --> 00:10:38.630
I forced you into a difficult 
position earlier.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.230
No,

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:44.870
I am sorry I allowed Nobu to act in 
that manner, despite my presence.

00:10:45.390 --> 00:10:50.760
Mitsuhide, you always share 
the burden of Nobu's actions.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:55.520
I wonder how many will 
realize his true intent...

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:01.870
Father has entrusted me 
with with his inheritance,

00:11:02.870 --> 00:11:06.800
to be given to Nobu at the right time.

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.680
Inheritance?

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:11.530
War is coming.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:15.280
The Oda clan must stand united without delay.

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:19.890
Everyone will say Nobukatsu should 
become the next clan lord.

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:24.780
Although Nobukatsu is too gentle 
to shoulder such a burden,

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:29.820
there is too little time for Nobu 
to make himself understood.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:31.990
Father's death...

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.910
was all too soon.

00:11:36.370 --> 00:11:40.610
And if this inheritance were to come 
to light under such circumstances,

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:44.660
it would only give rise to new strife.

00:11:45.230 --> 00:11:46.610
Ichihime-sama,

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.440
Nobu is a man who has both 
heaven and earth in his reach.

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:51.940
Mitsuhide...

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:54.090
It will be all right.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:58.330
The time for you to give him 
the inheritance will come.

00:11:58.890 --> 00:11:59.950
I swear it.

00:12:03.300 --> 00:12:06.550
You have nothing to fear.

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:24.730
Who the hell does he think he is?!

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.000
That attitude, that get-up...

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.690
There's no way he's the Savior-King!

00:12:30.700 --> 00:12:35.220
It is admirable that you are taking 
initiative in the matter of your departure.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.530
Would you like me to help?

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:39.550
Leave me alone!

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.040
Ah, how frightful.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:44.830
The golden-head will bite me!

00:12:45.550 --> 00:12:50.250
Maybe you should nullify your 
betrothal with Nobunaga soon, too.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.790
He's such a fool.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.850
You are unable to grasp the vastness 
of my fiancé's potential.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:57.070
You are still a child.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:58.520
Child?

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.710
Look who's talking.

00:13:00.710 --> 00:13:02.580
What?

00:13:02.860 --> 00:13:04.220
How dare you!

00:13:04.830 --> 00:13:06.740
You insolent girl!

00:13:06.740 --> 00:13:07.720
Get out!

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:09.580
Gladly!

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:18.640
Unless you are strong enough to 
see his goals and to support him,

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:23.430
you cannot hope to stay beside such 
a man in these war-torn times.

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:24.550
What?

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:27.780
That's my parting gift to you.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.710
What was that about?!

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:43.510
Is the Oda clan going to be all right?

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:46.290
We cannot possibly follow that fool.

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:48.220
Even as we wring our hands,

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.580
the Takeda forces will be sure to return.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:55.330
It would be for the best if Nobukatsu-sama 
became the clan lord.

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.280
Mitsuhide.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:04.970
These lands all belong to the 
Oda, as far as one can see.

00:14:06.170 --> 00:14:09.290
However, the scars of war 
still remain here and there.

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:13.320
And before those can heal, 
the Takeda will come yet again.

00:14:13.970 --> 00:14:18.090
I'd like to protect what Father 
tried to protect, as well.

00:14:18.090 --> 00:14:19.460
Dad!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:25.090
I don't wish for anyone to suffer 
the loss of a loved one again...

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:28.630
The Oda clan must achieve 
unity as soon as possible.

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:31.300
Mitsuhide.

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.020
Yes, my lord?

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.260
Shibata says he will hold 
a war council tomorrow.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:39.730
He would like me to become clan 
lord during my brother's absence.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:42.010
Don't misunderstand me.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:46.110
I have no intention of pushing my 
brother aside and seizing power.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:50.910
But many advisors oppose 
my brother's succession.

00:14:51.400 --> 00:14:55.620
And some have begun to 
scheme against my brother.

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:57.070
So,

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.860
I may acquiesce to their 
demands for the moment.

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:06.950
I will first unite the Oda 
Clan as the clan lord,

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:09.590
then eventually step aside for my brother.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:12.440
Should you become the clan lord,

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:16.910
how do you envision yourself 
ruling the Oda Clan?

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:19.380
I am not sure as of yet,

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:23.020
but I will seek everyone's cooperation

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.650
and avoid war as much as possible.

00:15:25.890 --> 00:15:26.910
Avoid?

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:28.830
With Takeda, Uesugi,

00:15:28.830 --> 00:15:34.380
and the other clans now poised 
to strike at any moment?

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:38.840
Even so, I intend to succeed the Oda Clan.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:42.090
I believe it to be the best way

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:44.290
to protect my brother, my sister,

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.480
and everyone in the clan.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:01.520
I knew you'd come by soon.

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:03.200
Da Vinci!

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:06.730
To think you would desert

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:10.610
the very man who was willing to 
steal a star ship for you.

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:13.170
How cruel!

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.040
Is this because of his behavior?

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:18.900
Nobunaga has nothing to do with it!

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:23.150
But what's the point of staying 
here when he's not the Savior-King?

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.050
I see.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:29.420
So you have determined 
what manner of man he is.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:30.720
The exact opposite.

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:33.710
I will never understand a guy like him,

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:35.480
nor do I wish to.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:39.350
Understanding the inscrutable

00:16:39.350 --> 00:16:42.800
requires objective 
observation, Mademoiselle.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:49.070
When I do this, you look to be 
the same size as my right hand.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:53.310
But that is not your true size, is it not?

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:57.330
Then are my eyes deceiving me?

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:01.320
The truth can be concealed by the 
position one chooses to take,

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.550
but can also be revealed once more.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:07.020
I won't draw any.

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:08.520
Come, now.

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:10.810
Do it as a parting farewell.

00:17:15.760 --> 00:17:17.990
It is Strength!

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:21.800
The beast symbolizes a mighty strength.

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:23.670
The woman embracing the beast signifies

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:28.830
that great strength needs to be 
supported by strength of another kind.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:31.790
I'm tired of your games!

00:17:31.790 --> 00:17:33.460
What are you trying to accomplish

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:35.680
by having me draw these cards?!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.480
I am not your pawn!

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:46.020
I wonder what manner of ley 
line vortex will engulf you.

00:17:48.260 --> 00:17:49.160
I'm counting on you.

00:17:49.390 --> 00:17:50.120
Yes, my lord!

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:53.820
Now, we must only wait for results.

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:02.590
Nobukatsu-sama,

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.610
once you agree to become the clan lord,

00:18:05.610 --> 00:18:07.740
you will not be allowed to step down.

00:18:08.780 --> 00:18:11.080
Your careful consideration of your advisors,

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:13.020
your desire for everyone's happiness...

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.900
In a different era,

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:19.170
you would have been a great ruler.

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:23.300
But,

00:18:24.150 --> 00:18:25.730
we live in a time of war.

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:31.690
Unless Nobu leads us,
 this hell cannot be tamed.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.740
Yes... I, who will follow 
the demon lord of Hell...

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:39.250
will also become a demon.

00:18:53.260 --> 00:18:57.430
Others just do not see his true self.

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:00.790
You are unable to grasp the vastness 
of my fiancé's potential.

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.410
You are still a child.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.920
What is that?

00:19:10.530 --> 00:19:11.610
A beast?

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:15.520
No, a voice...

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:08.770
Nobunaga?

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:41.320
Why...

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:48.870
Brother...

00:20:54.540 --> 00:20:56.690
I will become a demon!

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:07.560
Nobu...

00:21:10.730 --> 00:21:12.070
Nobunaga!

00:21:46.940 --> 00:21:47.890
Himiko.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:53.890
My betrothed...

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:56.870
I have fulfilled...

00:21:57.730 --> 00:22:01.080
my duty... as your wife...

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:05.090
This...

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:09.180
is love in a time of war.

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:27.430
Take care of... him.

00:24:12.310 --> 00:24:13.610
<i>Times are changing.</i>

00:24:14.330 --> 00:24:16.580
<i>The currents of old create new turmoil</i>

00:24:17.060 --> 00:24:18.470
<i>and so life continues on.</i>

00:24:19.230 --> 00:24:21.350
<i>Next time: The Hierophant.</i>

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:22.850
<i>Splendid!</i>

00:24:23.220 --> 00:24:25.160
<i>The manliest of men!</i>
